OL,3,GNEWSAArrest in connection with Pokemon
OL,4,Acards raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 33-year-old man has been arrested in
OL,7,Fconnection with the theft of thousands
OL,8,Fof pounds worth of Pokemon cards in
OL,9,FLincolnshire.
OL,11,FThe break-in happened at Trading Cards
OL,12,FGainsborough shortly after 03:15 BST on
OL,13,FSunday 9 August.
OL,15,FCCTV filmed two people getting into the
OL,16,FLord Street shop through a smashed
OL,17,Fwindow.
OL,19,FLincolnshire Police said the man was
OL,20,Farrested on Monday in connection with
OL,21,Fthe incident and had since been
OL,22,Freleased on bail.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
